WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:05.609
Today’s task: make squares of different sizes.

2
00:00:05.609 --> 00:00:10.827
Tap pegs in order to stretch a band around them.

3
00:00:10.827 --> 00:00:14.408
Close the band to finish the shape.

4
00:00:14.408 --> 00:00:21.677
Pick a new color, then make a tilted square.

5
00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:24.923
The tilted square has area 2. The total adds both.

6
00:00:24.923 --> 00:00:29.674
Fill off shows just the bands.

7
00:00:29.674 --> 00:00:36.447
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
